>
  <div class="legal-cards">
    <div class="legal-card"><p class="legal-card-big">14 days</p><p>Full refund of your first payment if you used under [1] hour of translation.</p></div>
    <div class="legal-card"><p class="legal-card-big">Any time</p><p>Cancel renewal. Your plan runs until the end of the paid period.</p></div>
    <div class="legal-card"><p class="legal-card-big">Pro-rated</p><p>If a service outage stops you using Tolkmeet for [24] hours or more.</p></div>
