  <h2 id="who">Who handles refunds</h2>
  <p>Paddle.com is our merchant of record. Refunds are issued by Paddle to your original payment method, usually within [5–10] business days.</p>

  <h2 id="first-payment">First payment</h2>
  <p>If you are not satisfied, ask for a refund within 14 days of your first payment of a plan. We refund it in full if you have used less than [1] hour of translated meetings. Above that, we refund the unused share of the plan.</p>

  <h2 id="renewals">Renewals and extra hours</h2>
  <p>Renewal payments and purchased extra hours are not refundable once translation time from them has been used. If a renewal charged you by mistake and you have not used it, write to us within 14 days.</p>

  <h2 id="legal-rights">Your legal rights</h2>
  <p>Nothing here limits rights you have under consumer protection law where you live, such as withdrawal rights in the European Union or Korea.</p>

  <h2 id="how-to-ask">How to ask</h2>
  <p>Go to Account › Plan and billing › View receipts and choose “Request a refund”, or email [billing@tolkmeet.com] with the email address on your account.</p>
</Legal>
